# Font Stack

## Display / Headings / Logo
Primary: **Sora** (Google Fonts) — logo wordmark and headlines.
Fallback: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif.
Rationale: brand identity guide — geometric, technical, modern.

## Body / UI
Primary: **Inter**.
Fallback: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif.

## Monospace
Primary: JetBrains Mono.
Fallback: "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace.

## Load via next/font (never via `<link>`)

## Scale
- hero: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) / 1.1 / -0.03em
- h1: 2.25rem / 1.15 / -0.02em
- h2: 1.75rem / 1.2 / -0.02em
- h3: 1.25rem / 1.3 / -0.01em
- body-lg: 1.125rem / 1.6
- body: 1rem / 1.6
- small: 0.875rem / 1.5
- caption: 0.75rem / 1.4 / +0.02em (uppercase only for labels)

## Rules
- Never more than 2 font families per page (display + body; mono only for metadata)
- Headlines in Instrument Serif: sentence case, not ALL CAPS
- Technical metadata (dimensions, file size, job ID) uses mono
- No italics except genuine editorial emphasis
